hermes-paseo-bridge
Copyright 2026 Max Gierlachowski

This plugin contains no third-party code. It runs inside Hermes Agent
(https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent) and uses only its public
plugin API plus the Python standard library. It receives webhooks from
paseo-mcp (https://github.com/MaxGierlachowski/paseo-mcp) for Paseo
(https://paseo.sh). The Standard Webhooks signature scheme is specified at
https://www.standardwebhooks.com; the test vector in tests/test_signature.py
is taken from that specification.

Hermes, Paseo and Claude are names of their respective owners. This project is
not affiliated with or endorsed by Nous Research or the Paseo authors.
